From: Maciej Krüger <mkg20001@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 21:00:00 +0200
Subject: libbabelhelper: raise CMake minimum version

CMake 4 removed compatibility with CMake < 3.5, so the build fails at
cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 2.8.8).

diff --git a/utils/libbabelhelper/patches/0001-raise-CMake-minimum-version.patch b/utils/libbabelhelper/patches/0001-raise-CMake-minimum-version.patch
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/utils/libbabelhelper/patches/0001-raise-CMake-minimum-version.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+--- a/CMakeLists.txt
++++ b/CMakeLists.txt
+@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@
+-cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 2.8.8)
++cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.5)
+
+ # list(APPEND CMAKE_MODULE_PATH ${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/cmake)
